msgid "This operation will attempt to convert your data to the new collation. In rare cases, especially where a character doesn't exist in the new collation, this process could cause the data to appear incorrectly under the new collation; in this case we suggest you revert to the original collation and refer to the tips at "
msgstr "Poseg bo poskušal pretvoriti vaše podatke v nova pravila za razvrščanje znakov. V redkih izjemah, še posebej, ko znak v novi razvrstitvi ne obstaja, lahko poseg povzroči, da se podatki v novi razvrstitvi ne prikažejo pravilno; v tem primeru vam predlagamo, da podatke povrnete v izvorno razvrščanje in si ogledate namige na "

